# Mark machine-generated / imported artifacts so GitHub collapses them in PR diffs
# and excludes them from language statistics.
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/working-with-files/managing-files/customizing-how-changed-files-appear-on-github

# Matched by name, not by path: a list has to be extended by hand, and stops
# matching without failing when a directory moves.
**/gen/** linguist-generated
**/__generated__/** linguist-generated

# External skill packages pulled via skills-lock.json (do not hand-edit)
.agents/skills/** linguist-vendored linguist-generated
